{"fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T19:01:50.438Z","pushedAt":"2026-10-23T08:08:08Z","branch":"main","issues":2,"watchers":1,"size":240571,"homepage":null,"archived":false,"files":50,"truncated":false,"readme":{"path":"README.md","html":"<h2 id=\"hand-drawn-styles\">hand-drawn-styles</h2>\n<p><strong>23 套手绘与插画画风配方，先看效果，再按编号使用。</strong> 覆盖蜡笔、水墨、线条漫画、水粉绘本、纸雕、像素与软胶潮玩。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg\" alt=\"License: MIT\" /></a></p>\n<p>告诉 Agent 要画什么、用哪种画风，它会填入内容、处理比例，输出完整提示词或带参考图的 JSON 调用包。<strong>本项目默认不生图</strong>，由你的图像工具执行。</p>\n<p><a href=\"#%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E7%94%BB%E9%A3%8E\">全部画风</a> · <a href=\"#%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85\">安装</a> · <a href=\"#%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8\">开始使用</a> · <a href=\"#%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E5%9B%BE%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82\">调用与参考图要求</a> · <a href=\"#%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E4%B8%8E%E8%B4%A1%E7%8C%AE\">维护与贡献</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"全部画风\">全部画风</h2>\n<p>当前共 <strong>23 套</strong>：编号 <strong>1–20、22、23</strong>，另含 <strong>3.1</strong> 变体。21 号已移除，不复用旧编号。点击样图可查看原图；详细输入示例见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/examples/README.md\">样例页</a>，用途与相近画风区别见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/style-selection.md\">选型说明</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>1 · 极简黑白线条讲解漫画</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/01-minimal-line.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/01-minimal-line.png\" alt=\"1 极简黑白线条讲解漫画\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>细线火柴人、网格分镜，用于步骤与概念讲解。<br /><code>minimal-line</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>2 · 蜡笔童涂</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/02-crayon.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/02-crayon.png\" alt=\"2 蜡笔童涂\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>孩子自己画的笨拙造型，歪线、出框和粗蜡笔。<br /><code>crayon</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>3 · 吉卜力风</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/03-ghibli.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/03-ghibli.png\" alt=\"3 吉卜力风\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>柔和水彩、暖光与手绘动画叙事。<br /><code>ghibli</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>3.1 · 蜡笔童涂－潦草自画版</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/assets/style-3.1/anchor-family.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/assets/style-3.1/anchor-family.png\" alt=\"3.1 蜡笔童涂－潦草自画版\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>大人歪线稿加孩子乱涂色，明亮白底与亲子动作。<br /><code>family-crayon-card</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>4 · 小豆人涂鸦信息图</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/04-bean-doodle.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/04-bean-doodle.png\" alt=\"4 小豆人涂鸦信息图\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>实心黑豆人、单橙点缀与竖向分格。<br /><code>bean</code></sub>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>5 · MS Paint 烂涂鸦</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/05-ms-paint.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/05-ms-paint.png\" alt=\"5 MS Paint 烂涂鸦\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>鼠标硬画的粗糙数字感，故意画得笨拙好笑。<br /><code>ms-paint</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>6 · 圆珠笔单线涂鸦</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/06-pen-scribble.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/06-pen-scribble.png\" alt=\"6 圆珠笔单线涂鸦\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>用缠绕线的疏密表现体积，适合肖像与动物。<br /><code>pen-scribble</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>7 · 蜡笔实拍</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/07-real-crayon.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/07-real-crayon.png\" alt=\"7 蜡笔实拍\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>像拍下来的儿童蜡笔纸页，保留纸面与蜡质笔触。<br /><code>real-crayon</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>8 · 水墨写意</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/08-ink-wash.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/08-ink-wash.png\" alt=\"8 水墨写意\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>毛笔浓淡、飞白与宣纸渗化，保留写意留白。<br /><code>ink-wash</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>9 · 复古像素</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/09-pixel-art.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/09-pixel-art.png\" alt=\"9 复古像素\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>硬边方块像素与有限调色板，呈现老游戏观感。<br /><code>pixel-art</code></sub>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>10 · 情绪叙事淡彩速写</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/10-emo-sketch.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/10-emo-sketch.png\" alt=\"10 情绪叙事淡彩速写\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>靛蓝松散速写线、大留白与一处橙色。<br /><code>emo-sketch</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>11 · 二维水彩风格</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/11-retro-concept.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/11-retro-concept.png\" alt=\"11 二维水彩风格\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>复古动画概念稿，白纸、粉彩与少量形状阴影。<br /><code>retro-concept</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>12 · 暖光童画</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/12-sunlit-storybook.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/12-sunlit-storybook.png\" alt=\"12 暖光童画\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>动画概念水粉笔触，可选留白纸边或满幅场景。<br /><code>sunlit-storybook</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>13 · 北欧纸雕</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/13-paper-folk.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/13-paper-folk.png\" alt=\"13 北欧纸雕\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>层叠厚纸、立体纸艺和柔和投影。<br /><code>paper-folk</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>14 · 北欧绘本水粉</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/14-nordic-storybook.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/14-nordic-storybook.png\" alt=\"14 北欧绘本水粉\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>整画纸纹、水粉颗粒与低饱和蓝黄。<br /><code>nordic-storybook</code></sub>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>15 · 大鼻软偶</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/15-softnose-vinyl.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/15-softnose-vinyl.png\" alt=\"15 大鼻软偶\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>哑光软胶、夸张垂管鼻与小眼睛潮玩角色。<br /><code>softnose-vinyl</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>16 · 聚光水粉立绘</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/16-gouache-spotlight.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/16-gouache-spotlight.png\" alt=\"16 聚光水粉立绘\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>满幅抽象刷底、人物身后聚光晕与夸张比例。<br /><code>gouache-spotlight</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>17 · 墨线绘本</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/17-inked-storybook.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/17-inked-storybook.png\" alt=\"17 墨线绘本\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>钢笔墨线定形，轻薄淡彩与局部排线。<br /><code>inked-storybook</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>18 · 暖色扁平绘本</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/18-warm-flat-storybook.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/18-warm-flat-storybook.png\" alt=\"18 暖色扁平绘本\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>圆润几何色块、蓝橙对比与流畅动作弧线。<br /><code>warm-flat-storybook</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>19 · 圆头红线极简童画</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/assets/style-19/anchor-roundhead-redline.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/assets/style-19/anchor-roundhead-redline.png\" alt=\"19 圆头红线极简童画\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>大圆头、双竖眼、细石墨四肢与珊瑚红。<br /><code>roundhead-redline</code></sub>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>20 · 暖黄墨线情绪小剧场</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/assets/style-20/anchor-warm-yellow-ink-story.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/assets/style-20/anchor-warm-yellow-ink-story.png\" alt=\"20 暖黄墨线情绪小剧场\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>紧凑形体、黑墨排线与芥末黄，聚焦一个动作。<br /><code>warm-yellow-ink-story</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>22 · 朱墨写意转绘</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/assets/style-22/anchor-vermilion-ink-wash.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/assets/style-22/anchor-vermilion-ink-wash.png\" alt=\"22 朱墨写意转绘\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>纸白漫画五官、游丝长线、完整墨团与少量朱红。<br /><code>vermilion-ink-wash</code></sub>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<strong>23 · 皮影彩染</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/23-shadow-puppet.png\"><img src=\"https://hand-drawn-images.pages.dev/hand-drawn/examples/23-shadow-puppet.png\" alt=\"23 皮影彩染：持扇女伶\" width=\"150\" /></a><br />\n<sub>灵感来自：DAAI(@daaihq)</sub><br />\n<sub>镂刻偶片、平面铆接、半透明彩染与整幅暖幕光。<br /><code>shadow-puppet</code><br /><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/style-23-review.md\">试作记录</a></sub>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</table><p>23号采用本轮已认可的持扇女伶图展示；全部23套画风均保留独立效果图。</p>\n<p>样图题材不同，用于展示已有画风，不代表同题对照实验或所有场景都已验证。3.1、19、20、22 展示的是正式调用所用画风锚点；审核与隐私记录见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/examples/README.md\">样例页</a> 和各画风说明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装\">安装</h2>\n<p>使用本页全部 23 套画风（含 22 号朱墨写意转绘与 23 号皮影彩染试作），可让 Agent 从当前源码安装：</p>\n<pre><code>帮我安装 https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles 的 main 分支，\n保留完整 Skill 目录，并运行 scripts/check_skill.py 验证安装。\n</code></pre>\n<p>也可以自行浅克隆，避免下载 Git 历史中的旧图片。运行脚本需要 <strong>Python 3.10+</strong>，无需第三方 Python 依赖：</p>\n<pre><code>git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles.git\ncd hand-drawn-styles\npython3 -B scripts/check_skill.py\n</code></pre>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>接入方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Codex</td>\n<td>将完整目录以 <code>hand-drawn/</code> 名称放入 <code>~/.codex/skills/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Code</td>\n<td>将完整目录以 <code>hand-drawn/</code> 名称放入 <code>~/.claude/skills/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cursor / Gemini CLI / Jules</td>\n<td>让项目规则指向完整目录中的 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 和 <code>PROTOCOL.md</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cline / Windsurf / Continue</td>\n<td>让 rules / custom instructions 指向完整目录中的协议与配方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接对话</td>\n<td>普通文本配方可复制；需要锚点的调用须同时传入真实参考图与完整调用包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/releases/latest/download/hand-drawn-skill.zip\">Release 轻量安装包</a> 对应已发布版本，<strong>可能落后于本页 main 分支</strong>；校验文件见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/releases/latest/download/SHA256SUMS\">SHA256SUMS</a>。完整安装与验证方式见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/INSTALL.md\">INSTALL.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开始使用\">开始使用</h2>\n<h3 id=\"对-agent-说清楚内容和画风\">对 Agent 说清楚内容和画风</h3>\n<p>中文名、编号或英文别名都可以：</p>\n<pre><code>用吉卜力风画一只在下雨天打伞的猫。\n用 3 号画风画一只在下雨天打伞的猫。\n用 ghibli 画一只在下雨天打伞的猫。\n</code></pre>\n<p>“家庭蜡笔画”“亲子手绘”等已登记的自然语言表达直接采用 3.1。未指定画风时，Agent 根据用途提供 2–3 个候选供你选择；用途不清楚时展示完整菜单。指定比例就使用该比例，不指定时不额外锁定数字比例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用脚本输出提示词\">用脚本输出提示词</h3>\n<pre><code>python3 -B scripts/render_prompt.py \\\n  --style ink-wash \\\n  --subject '一只鸟停在细枝上' \\\n  --aspect 3:4\n</code></pre>\n<p>其余参数用 <code>--var '名称=内容'</code> 填入；完整编号、别名和必需参数可这样查询：</p>\n<pre><code>python3 -B scripts/render_prompt.py --list\npython3 -B scripts/render_prompt.py --catalog\n</code></pre>\n<p><code>--catalog</code> 另含适用任务、识别差异、限制与来源，仅查询本地文本，不需要图片缓存。配方的唯一真源是 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/STYLES.md\">STYLES.md</a>，渲染器原样提取；选型建议不覆盖配方。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用-22-号转绘原图\">用 22 号转绘原图</h3>\n<pre><code>python3 -B scripts/render_prompt.py \\\n  --style vermilion-ink-wash \\\n  --subject '原图人物扶着自行车，保留眼镜、姿态和车架连接' \\\n  --source-image /absolute/path/source.jpg \\\n  --text '只保留球衣上的10'\n</code></pre>\n<p>22 号采用用户认可的 <code>sweety-ink-wash v1.1.0</code> 第一风格，与 8 号传统水墨分开保留。默认返回画风锚点、内容原图和完整 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/image-art-direction.md\">sweety-image-art-direction 预处理说明</a>。调用端先执行预处理，再把实际图片按角色传入图像工具：<strong>原图决定内容，锚点决定画法</strong>，不复制锚点中的人物、自行车或号码。选择范围与既有验证见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/style-22-review.md\">迁入记录</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用-23-号创作独立皮影\">用 23 号创作独立皮影</h3>\n<p>灵感来自：DAAI(@daaihq)</p>\n<pre><code>python3 -B scripts/render_prompt.py --style shadow-puppet \\\n  --subject '一只白鹤抬起一只脚，展开一侧翅膀' --aspect 3:4\n</code></pre>\n<p>23号为 v0.1 首版，无需原片，输出完整皮影画面而非照片对照海报。内部保留轮廓提炼、偶件拆分与颜色选择，成图只呈现半透明彩染偶片和暖幕。默认无字；配色可用 <code>--var '配色=琥珀黄与橄榄绿'</code> 指定。来源与试作边界见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/style-23-review.md\">23号记录</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调用与参考图要求\">调用与参考图要求</h2>\n<p>普通画风默认输出纯文本；<strong>3.1、19、20、22 默认输出 JSON 调用包</strong>。拿到 JSON 只是完成提示词准备，调用端还须实际传入图片并执行相应流程。</p>\n<pre><code>python3 -B scripts/render_prompt.py \\\n  --style 3.1 \\\n  --subject '爸爸把零食袋放回柜子，男孩站在旁边看着' \\\n  --text '不加任何文字' \\\n  --aspect 3:4\n</code></pre>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>画风</th>\n<th>调用要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3.1</td>\n<td>每张携带锚点；执行基础生成、两次递进编辑与独立验收，通过后才可成为 final。准确标题用 <code>--title</code>，详见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/style-3.1-review.md\">验收说明</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>携带原创锚点，满足调用包中的模型快照与高保真参考要求；按既有审核和硬失败条件放行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>携带原创锚点，直接生成候选，再执行验收器；失败候选拒收，不用通用风格编辑修补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>先执行内置美术指导预处理，再传入画风锚点与可选内容原图；核对关键主体、姿态与物件连接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>3.1、19、20 的候选状态、精确模型要求与放行条件以正式调用包为准。缺参考图、模型能力或审核证据时，停止对应正式调用。3.1/19/20/22 只有显式添加 <code>--format text --text-only-preview</code> 才能输出非生产文字预览。</p>\n<p>图片托管于 <strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong>。首次使用参考图需要联网下载并校验大小和 SHA-256；有效缓存可离线复用。2026-10-23，图库全部 77 张图片已通过匿名下载校验，运行所需 6 张参考图已通过空缓存下载验证。图片迁移不改变历史隐私审计与视觉审核结论。</p>\n<p>工程检查、实际看图审核和用户认可分别记录。历史样图的证据范围、三组相近画风的差异与失败案例见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/style-comparison.md\">画风对照</a>；其中规划的小规模同题实验尚未执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"维护与贡献\">维护与贡献</h2>\n<pre><code>python3 -B scripts/hosted_images.py fetch\npython3 -B -m unittest discover -s scripts -p 'test_*.py'\npython3 -B scripts/check_skill.py\npython3 -B scripts/build_skill_package.py\n</code></pre>\n<p>构建脚本在独立目录解压并验证全部画风，成功才标为 <code>verified</code>；默认产物 <code>dist/hand-drawn-skill.zip</code> 不含图片且不超过 1 MiB。<code>--skip-verify</code> 仅生成候选包。</p>\n<p><code>HAND_DRAWN_IMAGE_CACHE</code> 指定图片缓存；<code>HAND_DRAWN_OFFLINE=1</code> 禁止自动下载。业务项目提供内容、准确文字、比例和可选角色参考，不另写一套画风配方。</p>\n<p>新增画风须固定参考图、同构与跨主体场景，记录判定依据和可复核候选；新增图片须先完成隐私清理、登记、完整图库部署与匿名校验。完整规则见 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/AGENTS.md\">AGENTS.md</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/image-hosting.md\">图片托管说明</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件 / 目录</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/STYLES.md\">STYLES.md</a></td>\n<td>全部配方的唯一真源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/PROTOCOL.md\">PROTOCOL.md</a></td>\n<td>选型、参数与输出协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/SKILL.md\">SKILL.md</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/AGENTS.md\">AGENTS.md</a></td>\n<td>Skill 与跨工具入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/catalog/\">catalog/</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/docs/\">docs/</a></td>\n<td>选型数据、对照、验收与托管说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/scripts/\">scripts/</a></td>\n<td>渲染、验收、安装、打包与检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/assets/image-manifest.json\">assets/image-manifest.json</a></td>\n<td>图片地址、大小和 SHA-256</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/examples/\">examples/</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/benchmarks/\">benchmarks/</a></td>\n<td>编号样例与历史研发记录，不进入轻量包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"license\">License</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/blob/main/LICENSE\">MIT</a> © liulei</p>\n","toc":[{"id":"hand-drawn-styles","text":"hand-drawn-styles","level":2},{"id":"全部画风","text":"全部画风","level":2},{"id":"安装","text":"安装","level":2},{"id":"开始使用","text":"开始使用","level":2},{"id":"对-agent-说清楚内容和画风","text":"对 Agent 说清楚内容和画风","level":3},{"id":"用脚本输出提示词","text":"用脚本输出提示词","level":3},{"id":"用-22-号转绘原图","text":"用 22 号转绘原图","level":3},{"id":"用-23-号创作独立皮影","text":"用 23 号创作独立皮影","level":3},{"id":"调用与参考图要求","text":"调用与参考图要求","level":2},{"id":"维护与贡献","text":"维护与贡献","level":2},{"id":"license","text":"License","level":2}]},"skills":[{"name":"hand-drawn","description":"Use when users ask for a hand-drawn or illustrated image prompt, name one of the repository's 22 numbered styles or the 3.1 stable variant, or mention triggers such as 亲子手绘、家庭蜡笔画、蜡笔、吉卜力、水墨、像素、淡彩速写、动画概念、水粉、北欧绘本、纸雕、软胶潮玩、墨线绘本、暖色扁平绘本、圆头红线、暖黄墨线、family-crayon-card、warm-flat-storybook、roundhead-redline、war","path":""}],"skillCount":1,"marketplace":false,"plugin":false,"docker":false,"npm":null,"pypi":null,"install":{},"releases":[{"tag":"v1.2.0","name":"公开图片托管与无图片安装包","date":"2026-10-09T01:56:11Z","url":"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/releases/tag/v1.2.0","pre":false},{"tag":"v1.1.0","name":"定稿画风与轻量安装包","date":"2026-10-08T06:51:48Z","url":"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/releases/tag/v1.1.0","pre":false},{"tag":"v1.0.0","name":"v1.0.0 · 轻量安装包与安装修复","date":"2026-10-08T04:27:33Z","url":"https://github.com/threerocks/hand-drawn-styles/releases/tag/v1.0.0","pre":false}],"contributors":[{"login":"threerocks","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16551316?v=4","n":50}]}
